"_index":32,"t":{"7":{"position":[[84,12]]}}}],["verifi",{"_index":20,"t":{"5":{"position":[[54,8]]}}}],["waylock",{"_index":7,"t":{"3":{"position":[[0,7]]},"5":{"position":[[70,7]]}}}],["waylock'",{"_index":2,"t":{"1":{"position":[[17,9]]}}}]],"pipeline":["stemmer"]}},{"documents":[],"index":{"version":"2.3.9","fields":["t"],"fieldVectors":[],"invertedIndex":[],"pipeline":["stemmer"]}},{"documents":[{"i":2,"t":"Guide updates No public guide update has a publication date yet. Once the site is released and a real publication date exists, this page will link each dated change to its guide so you can inspect what was verified at that point. Subscribe to RSS No public updates yet.","s":"Guide updates","u":"/feed","h":"","p":1},{"i":4,"t":"Read the Privacy Policy for information about Waylock data, the Terms of Service for service conditions, and account deletion for the signed-in deletion flow after uninstalling the app. For a product or account question, email aoneahsan@gmail.com. Account deletion uses the signed-in page, not an email request.","s":"Where can I find account and data information?","u":"/guide/account-and-data","h":"","p":3},{"i":6,"t":"Waylock is in development. The Android app is not listed on Google Play yet. The team is checking the signed release on devices, external services, account flows and Play submission. This page will change when a public listing and the released app have been verified. Until then, the guides explain planned controls; they are not a claim that you can install or use them today. If you need a current update, contact the Waylock team.","s":"Is Waylock available yet?","u":"/guide/release-status","h":"","p":5},{"i":8,"t":"Waylock is in development. These controls describe the planned Android experience. Device and released-app checks remain open, so these are not steps for an available Play release.","s":"How are Waylock routes meant to work?","u":"/guide/route-controls","h":"","p":7},{"i":10,"t":"A stop lock is intended to keep a chosen delivery stop in a planned position while other stops can be reordered around it. Review the estimated order and its constraints while stopped, before setting off.","s":"What does holding a delivery stop do?","u":"/guide/route-controls","h":"#what-does-holding-a-delivery-stop-do","p":7},{"i":12,"t":"The Trip planner is intended to find a matching stop within the distance range you choose along the route. The range is measured from the origin or a previous stop. Confirm the proposed place and route before using guidance.","s":"Where can a distance-range stop go?","u":"/guide/route-controls","h":"#where-can-a-distance-range-stop-go","p":7},{"i":14,"t":"Waylock is designed to keep your chosen route visible as an overlay. Google Navigation SDK may still reroute its guidance. The planned choices are to review a way back to the chosen route or adopt a new route. Make that choice while stopped. For the release position, see Is Waylock available yet?.","s":"What happens after a wrong turn?","u":"/guide/route-controls","h":"#what-happens-after-a-wrong-turn","p":7},{"i":16,"t":"Find a Waylock guide Start with the guide for your next question. The Android app is still in development, and the signed-device and Play checks remain open, so check release status before treating any planned route control as available in a released app. XML sitemapRSS feedllms.txt Search pages ⌂ Guide overview Start with Waylock's current status and the route-control guide index. ◷ Release status Check what remains before Waylock can be verified on Google Play. ◇ Route controls Read about the planned stop lock, distance range and locked route. □ Account and data Find the legal pages, support contact and planned signed-in deletion path. ↗ Guide updates Read dated guide changes once a public update exists. ▦ All topics Browse the published guides by topic. ◇ Account guides Open the account and data guide. ◇ Android guides Open the current Android release-status guide. ◇ Navigation guides Open the planned route-controls guide. ◇ Privacy guides Open the account and data guide for legal and deletion links. ◇ Release guides Open the current release-status guide. ◇ Route guides Open the planned route-controls guide. ◇ Stop guides Open the planned stop-lock and distance-range guide. ◇ Support guides Open the account and data guide for the support contact.","s":"Find a Waylock guide","u":"/sitemap","h":"","p":15}],"index":{"version":"2.3.9","fields":["t"],"fieldVectors":[["t/2",[0,1.617,1,1.617,2,1.712,3,2.193,4,1.519,5,2.125,6,0.584,7,2.125,8,1.519,9,0.822,10,1.519,11,2.125,12,1.12,13,2.125,14,1.12,15,2.125,16,2.125,17,2.125]],["t/4",[9,0.804,18,1.486,19,1.486,20,2.078,21,2.078,22,0.571,23,1.486,24,2.078,25,1.946,26,2.078,27,1.6,28,2.17,29,1.435,30,1.486,31,2.078,32,0.804,33,2.078,34,1.486,35,2.722,36,2.078,37,1.096,38,2.078]],["t/6",[0,0.979,1,0.979,2,0.979,6,0.694,9,0.718,12,0.979,14,0.979,22,0.694,25,1.327,27,0.979,29,0.979,30,1.327,32,0.977,37,0.979,39,0.979,40,0.979,41,2.525,42,0.979,43,1.331,44,2.525,45,0.979,46,0.979,47,1.857,48,1.857,49,1.857,50,1.857,51,0.51,52,0.979,53,1.857,54,1.857,55,1.857,56,1.857,57,1.327,58,1.327]],["t/8",[6,0.818,22,0.657,32,0.924,39,1.26,40,1.26,43,1.26,45,1.26,46,1.26,51,0.657,52,1.26,59,2.389,60,2.389,61,1.708,62,1.708,63,2.389,64,1.26]],["t/10",[51,0.641,65,1.3,66,1.667,67,1.667,68,1.667,69,1.667,70,2.331,71,1.667,72,2.331,73,2.331,74,1.667,75,2.331,76,2.331,77,2.331,78,1.229,79,2.331]],["t/12",[37,1.158,65,1.092,67,1.571,78,1.158,80,2.198,81,2.198,82,1.571,83,2.198,84,2.198,85,1.571,86,2.017,87,2.198,88,2.198,89,1.487,90,2.198,91,2.198,92,2.198,93,2.198,94,2.198,95,2.198,96,1.571]],["t/14",[6,0.559,22,0.738,42,1.072,51,0.559,64,1.072,65,0.787,68,1.454,69,1.919,71,1.454,74,1.454,89,1.583,96,1.454,97,2.034,98,2.034,99,2.034,100,1.454,101,2.034,102,1.454,103,2.034,104,2.684,105,2.034,106,2.034,107,2.034,108,2.034,109,2.034,110,2.034]],["t/16",[0,1.793,1,0.735,2,0.447,3,0.606,4,0.606,6,0.673,8,0.606,9,0.539,10,0.606,12,0.447